  "referenceNumber": "RUS3505",
  "remarks": "\nThe Secretary of State considers that there are reasonable grounds to suspect that Mikhail Yurievich VOLOVIK is or has been involved in destabilising Ukraine or undermining or threatening the territorial integrity, sovereignty or independence of Ukraine, by \nowning or controlling directly or indirectly a person \nmaking available goods, technology or funds that could contribute to destabilising Ukraine or undermining or threatening the territorial integrity, sovereignty or independence of Ukraine. \n",
